From 5c79a315fd4a8b32d2c78802c3e4946fe4abbce2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:16:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: remove language keys identical to a baseline pack and
 support versioned baseline packs

Add the skip_language_keys_identical_to_baseline global option, enabled by
default (PackSquash #197). Entries of .json and .lang language files that
have the same value in the baseline pack language file are removed, and files
that end up empty are left out. Repeated keys in .lang files use the last
value, like the game does.

Add the baseline_pack_version global option and support for baseline packs
that hold many game versions. Such packs have a baseline.json index at their
root. Each version only stores the files it added or changed, and lists the
files it deleted.

Replace the data read for a pack file with in-memory data when needed.
